{"product":{"id":6596043538505,"title":"Adjustable Angle Hinge Connector","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Adjustable Angle Connector is one of the most versatile structural pipe fittings in the Maker Pipe building system. You can choose from two available sizes that are designed to natively fit either 3\/4\" or 1\" EMT Conduit respectively. EMT Conduit is readily available at your local hardware store. The 1\/2\" connector variant includes the needed adapter shims for building with 1\/2\" EMT Conduit. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Adjustable Angle Connector gives you the ability to achieve any angle up to 90 degrees in either direction. Use the provided hardware to secure two pipes at a desired angle or partially tighten the top bolt and nut to create a hinge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e*Hardware is included with each Adjustable Angle Hinge Connector\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- split --\u003e\n\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eAdjustable Angle Connector Overview\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2707\/6934\/files\/My_Post_43.png?v=1602692321\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube\" data-embed=\"VnWF5-n8hNM\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row cc-two-columns\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns omega\"\u003e\n\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"text-align: left; font-weight: bold;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSTEEL CONSTRUCTION\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZINC CORROSION RESISTANT \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eINTERLOCKING PUZZLE PIECE\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eDescription\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eThe Adjustable Angle Connector consists of four pieces. The two long pieces secure a terminating pipe and create the end clamp. The two smaller pieces have interlocking puzzle pieces that secure a through pipe and create the puzzle piece clamp. You can buy all four pieces together or buy the bottom\/top half separately if you need one and not the other.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns alpha\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: right:;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2707\/6934\/files\/Adjustable_Hinge_Dimentions.png?v=1629477268\" alt=\"Adjustable Angle Connector Dimensions\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/2707\/6934\/files\/made-in-america_98ab6f87-914b-4f83-98b5-0037a9abf072.gif?v=1602017519\" alt=\"Made in Ameria\" width=\"300\" height=\"400\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003chr class=\"cc-divider\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row cc-two-columns\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns alpha\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e10 Building Tips \u0026amp; Tricks\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube\" data-embed=\"UgzVzdTgG_U\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns omega\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eSee The Adjustable Angle In Action\u003